Description: Mengfei (梦飞输入法) Native Wayland Input Engine
 梦飞输入法 (Mengfei IME),  works with gxde-wlcom.
 Pinyin engine powered by librime (Rime), integrates with the compositor via
 zwp_input_method_v2 (applications keep using zwp-text-input-v3).